{
  "slug": "deploy-on-aws",
  "name": "Deploy On Aws",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deploy applications to AWS with architecture recommendations, cost estimates, and IaC deployment.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 hook** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `aws-architecture-diagram` (Generate validated AWS architecture diagrams as draw.io XML using official AWS4 icon libraries), `deploy` (Deploy applications to AWS), `elastic-beanstalk` (Deploy to AWS Elastic Beanstalk)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (3): `awsiac`, `awsknowledge`, `awspricing`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deploy-on-aws@claude-plugins-official` from `awslabs/agent-plugins` (`plugins/deploy-on-aws`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
